<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hexo on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/categories/hexo/</link><description>Recent content in Hexo on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2024 13:38:33 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/categories/hexo/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Add a Photo Gallery to Hexo NexT with Standalone HTML and iframe</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/adphgahene.html</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2024 13:38:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/adphgahene.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Rather than tightly coupling a gallery to one Hexo theme, this approach builds it as standalone HTML and embeds it in a normal page.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Create the page:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;hexo new page photos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Add a menu entry in the theme configuration:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-2"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;menu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;photos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;/photos/ || fa fa-camera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Embed the standalone gallery in &lt;code&gt;source/photos/index.md&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-2-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-2-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;iframe&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;max-width:100%&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;frameborder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;0&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;width&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;100%&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;height&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;750&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;https://lengmo714.top/net/photos/index.html&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;iframe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Place the gallery under the theme or site source directory, for example &lt;code&gt;source/net/photos/&lt;/code&gt;. Its primary &lt;code&gt;index.html&lt;/code&gt; links to individual album pages. Each album displays thumbnails and a modal:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Add Algolia Search to Hexo: Index Setup, API Keys and Deployment</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/adalsehein.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Aug 2023 22:21:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/adalsehein.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;My blog previously had no search feature, so I added one with Algolia. These are the important setup points.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="create-an-algolia-account"&gt;Create an Algolia Account&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#create-an-algolia-account"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Register through the &#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://dashboard.algolia.com/" title="Algolia dashboard" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; Algolia dashboard&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt; and create an application and index.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="install-the-hexo-integration"&gt;Install the Hexo Integration&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#install-the-hexo-integration"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install and configure &#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LouisBarranqueiro/hexo-algoliasearch" title="hexo-algoliasearch" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;code&gt;hexo-algoliasearch&lt;/code&gt;&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt; by following its documentation. Map the application ID, index name, and search-only key to the corresponding fields in your Hexo/theme configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Deploy Hexo to Alibaba Cloud with Git Hooks, Nginx and HTTPS</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/dehealclgi.html</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 22:57:45 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/dehealclgi.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This deployment has two parts: pushing Hexo&amp;rsquo;s generated static files to the server, and configuring a web server to serve that directory.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="upload-generated-files-with-git"&gt;Upload generated files with Git&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#upload-generated-files-with-git"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="create-a-dedicated-git-user"&gt;Create a dedicated Git user&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#create-a-dedicated-git-user"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo adduser git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Configure SSH access for that account. Add your &lt;strong&gt;public&lt;/strong&gt; key to &lt;code&gt;~git/.ssh/authorized_keys&lt;/code&gt;, then apply restrictive permissions:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-2"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-3"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-4"&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-5"&gt;5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo mkdir -p /home/git/.ssh&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo touch /home/git/.ssh/authorized_keys&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo chmod &lt;span class="m"&gt;700&lt;/span&gt; /home/git/.ssh&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo chmod &lt;span class="m"&gt;600&lt;/span&gt; /home/git/.ssh/authorized_keys&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo chown -R git:git /home/git/.ssh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Test from your local terminal:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Style Hexo Matery Categories with EJS Cards and Notebook CSS Animation</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/sthemacaej.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Oct 2022 23:04:50 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/sthemacaej.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;After switching to the Matery theme, I customized its category page so each category looks like an animated notebook.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s1.ax1x.com/2022/11/03/xqs36I.png" alt="Notebook-style category cards" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s1.ax1x.com/2022/11/03/xqs11A.png" alt="Category card hover effect" /&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Theme internals can change between releases. Commit or back up the theme before editing it, and reapply the customization carefully after upgrades.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;h2 id="replace-the-category-markup"&gt;Replace the category markup&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#replace-the-category-markup"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open &lt;code&gt;layout/category-cloud.ejs&lt;/code&gt;. Replace the original category chip with this structure while retaining the surrounding link generated by the theme:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Customize Hexo NexT Archive Pages with post-collapse and CSS</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/cuhenearpa.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Oct 2022 14:06:35 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/cuhenearpa.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The customized Hexo archive page looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s1.ax1x.com/2022/11/03/xqsc7T.jpg" alt="Customized NexT archive page" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This article targeted a NexT version that mixed Nunjucks and Swig templates. Current NexT releases may use different files, so first inspect &lt;code&gt;themes/next/layout&lt;/code&gt; and adapt the idea rather than blindly replacing theme internals.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="archive-entry-macro"&gt;Archive entry macro&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#archive-entry-macro"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The custom macro groups posts by year, displays &lt;code&gt;MM-DD&lt;/code&gt;, and applies custom classes:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-13"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-14"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-15"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-15"&gt;15&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-16"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-17"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-18"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-19"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-19"&gt;19&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-20"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-21"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-22"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-22"&gt;22&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-23"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-23"&gt;23&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-24"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-24"&gt;24&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-25"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-25"&gt;25&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-26"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-27"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-27"&gt;27&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-28"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-28"&gt;28&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-29"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-29"&gt;29&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-30"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-31"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-31"&gt;31&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{% macro render(posts) %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- set current_year = &amp;#39;1970&amp;#39; %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- for post in posts.toArray() %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- set year = date(post.date, &amp;#39;YYYY&amp;#39;) %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- if year !== current_year %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- set current_year = year %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;div class=&amp;#34;collection-year&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;h2 class=&amp;#34;collection-header&amp;#34;&amp;gt;{{ current_year }}&amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- endif %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;article class=&amp;#34;my-post&amp;#34; itemscope itemtype=&amp;#34;https://schema.org/Article&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;header class=&amp;#34;my-post-header&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;time class=&amp;#34;my-post-time&amp;#34;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; datetime=&amp;#34;{{ moment(post.date).format() }}&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {{ date(post.date, &amp;#39;MM-DD&amp;#39;) }}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/time&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;h3 class=&amp;#34;my-post-title&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;a class=&amp;#34;my-post-title-link&amp;#34;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; href=&amp;#34;{{ url_for(post.path) }}&amp;#34;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; itemprop=&amp;#34;url&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;span itemprop=&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {{ post.title or __(&amp;#39;post.untitled&amp;#39;) }}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/h3&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/header&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &amp;lt;/article&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {%- endfor %}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{% endmacro %}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;h2 id="styling"&gt;Styling&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#styling"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add the styles through NexT&amp;rsquo;s supported custom stylesheet hook when available:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Add a jVectorMap Travel Footprint Map to Hexo NexT</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/adjvtrfoma.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Oct 2022 01:12:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/adjvtrfoma.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This approach is theme-independent because the map can live in a standalone static page:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s1.ax1x.com/2022/11/03/xqsHHK.jpg" alt="Travel footprint map" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;a href="https://lengmo714.top/net/map/index.html" title="Demo" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#13;&#10; Demo&#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The historical implementation uses the jQuery-based jVectorMap project. Its original site and old dependencies may no longer be maintained, so self-host pinned files, review them before use, and consider a maintained SVG mapping library for a new project.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="get-the-example"&gt;Get the example&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#get-the-example"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/HelloWuJiaYi/jVectorMap-Footprint&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;img src="https://s1.ax1x.com/2022/11/03/xqs7B6.jpg" alt="jVectorMap project files" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Include one map-data file together with jQuery, the library, and its stylesheet:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>